Z||000005||BBBAD GT||06-28-2000||04:09 PM||||I am not lieing, last year, I was in the semi-final round of Trophy class (bracket racing) at our local dragstrip aganist a Festiva with my Stang. He was given his green light, and I waited...and waited...and waited...and waited...I think he had a 13-14 sec dial in for the 1/8 mi, while I had a mid 7 sec (was running street tires).   Finally, I got a green, he was right at half track.  I ripped through the gears, and passed him like he was standing still about 5 feet before the finish line.  I was doing close to 100 mph, he was at around 50-60 mph.  <P>I won, but it was a horrible looking win.<P>||||reg||1
